{"title":"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A cyclist drives from town A to town B with velocity <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/a/f4ae47cfb7e0c06b7151066ab9d588013d0bb51b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$40 \\frac{\\mathrm{km}}{\\mathrm{h}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"45\" height=\"37\" /> and comes back with velocity <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/2/7e227601fa638a7d1f06a10c3e4ed26b72486a79.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$60 \\frac{\\mathrm{km}}{\\mathrm{h}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"45\" height=\"37\" />. The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mean\" title=\"Mean\">mean</a> velocity in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/5/325ef1d0582d0425768ec05e108a55a38fc939fa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\mathrm{km}}{\\mathrm{h}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"27\" height=\"37\" /> for the total distance is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/1/a312446bdcbf8d74771d65d964d5a833ab6cad85.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A) \\ } 45\\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ } 48\\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\ } 50\\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\ } 55\\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\ } 100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"399\" height=\"20\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Distance\" title=\"Distance\">distance</a> from town A to town B, in kilometers, be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>The time it took the cyclist to travel from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> was <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/b/18b7d94f017d07ab0d5dae8354f33e6032796fda.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{d}{40}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"20\" height=\"38\" /> hours.\n</p><p>The time it took the cyclist to travel from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> was <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/5/d252f90a517f512842f734ef9acddb5ff585a9fa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{d}{60}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"20\" height=\"37\" /> hours.\n</p><p>The cyclist's mean velocity was <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/6/5e67e3035a034655ab44e1d27ff4baeb799a340a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2d}{\\frac{d}{40}+\\frac{d}{60}}=\\frac{2d}{\\frac{100d}{2400}}= \\frac{4800d}{100d}=48\\frac{\\mathrm{km}}{\\mathrm{h}} \\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{ B}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"316\" height=\"44\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; align:center; width:60%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum\">2007 Cyprus MO, Lyceum</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problems\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problems\">Problems</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_2\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_4\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_1\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_2\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_4\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_5\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_6\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_7\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyce